Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ヤッホ～！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀吼～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}すげえな！　これで\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊！这样一来
